==German==

===Etymology===
From early modern (15th century) {{m|de|gehiuse}}, {{m|de|geheus}}, a collective form built on {{der|de|gmh|hūs||house}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ɡəˈhɔɪ̯zə/}}
* {{rhymes|de|ɔɪ̯zə|s=3}}
* {{audio|de|De-Gehäuse.ogg|Audio}}

